{"id":"tempe_te","lemma":"tempête","pos":"noun","rank":1701,"glosses":["storm, tempest"],"ipa":"/tɑ̃.pɛt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b0/Fr-temp%C3%AAte.ogg/Fr-temp%C3%AAte.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"tempêtes"},"formAudio":{"tempêtes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/85/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-temp%C3%AAtes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Après une tempête vient le calme.","en":"After a storm comes the calm.","words":[{"g":"after"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"calm"}]},{"text":"Cette tempête-là aussi passera.","en":"This storm will also pass.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null,{"g":"there"},{"g":"too, also, as well"},{"g":"to pass","l":"passer"}]},{"text":"Après la tempête, ce fut calme.","en":"After the storm, it was calm.","words":[{"g":"after"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"bole","l":"fût"},{"g":"calm"}]},{"text":"Nous étions pris dans une tempête.","en":"We were caught in a storm.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"La tempête a fait arrêter le train.","en":"The storm stopped the train.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"to stop"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"train"}]}]}